From 7f7713369bcbcd52b3e4b5cddde4ebe90f1220ae Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: yangsonglin13 <yangsonglin566@gmail.com>
Date: Fri, 9 Oct 2026 16:22:15 +0800
Subject: [PATCH 9/9] fix(rfork): gate seed publication digest checks by
 processed layout

Keep checkpoint-layout seed keys bound to destination registration while
refreshing memory registrations and manifests after post-load reshapes.
Validate publication-time digests only for processed-layout transfers and
stop advertisement when their structure changes.

Add regression coverage for immediate and deferred promotion, fallback,
and storage replacement, and update the bilingual RFork guide.

Signed-off-by: yangsonglin13 <yangsonglin566@gmail.com>
(cherry picked from commit afea3e9b6137c8a76f45c8b4a9aaf623369215e6)
Signed-off-by: AbyssSkb <abyssskb@outlook.com>
